{
    "name": "paint-pseudo",
    "page": "page.html",
    "viewport": [
        800,
        600
    ],
    "_comment": "伪元素清单用例：::before 的空 content 装饰条（生成盒 + 绝对定位 + 四边拉伸）、::after 的文本 content（定位到右上角）、以及 ::before 作为行内文本前缀参与行盒。三个盒子只用纯色背景，失败能直接归到伪元素上；用例含文字，像素对照按 text-aa 走。docs/PIPELINE.md 目前把伪元素列在 P0 之外，修的时候要一起改文档。",
    "matrix": [
        "paint.pseudo",
        "position.out-of-flow",
        "flow.inline"
    ],
    "required": false,
    "steps": [
        {
            "op": "load"
        },
        {
            "op": "resize",
            "w": 800,
            "h": 600
        },
        {
            "op": "trace"
        },
        {
            "op": "capture"
        }
    ],
    "expect": "golden/",
    "pixels": "text-aa",
    "text": {
        "breaks": false,
        "advances": false
    }
}